<div class="col-sm-4 mb-2">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3 text-center d-flex flex-column">
        <img src="../assets/images/settings-avatar.png" alt="avatar" class="py-7 px-17">
        <div class="d-flex flex-sm-column flex-sm-column-reverse">
            <a href="">刪除照片</a>
            <div>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-dark"><h6 class="fs-6">上傳新照片</h6></button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="col-sm-8">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col">
            <div>

            
            <form action="" class="bg-white rounded-top-3 p-7">
                <div class="mb-7">
                    <label class="form-label" for="accountName">姓名</label>
                    <input type="text" name="accountName" id="accountName" class="form-control bg-white px-5 py-2" placeholder="Ariel">
                </div>
                <div class="mb-7">
                    <label class="form-label" for="accountNickname">暱稱</label>
                    <input type="text" name="accountNickname" id="accountNickname" class="form-control bg-white px-5 py-2" placeholder="王小羽">
                </div>
                <div class="mb-7">
                    <label class="form-label" for="accountEmail">電子郵件</label>
                    <input type="email" name="accountEmail" id="accountEmail" class="form-control bg-white px-5 py-2" placeholder="abc123@gmail.com">
                </div>
                <div class="mb-7">
                    <label class="form-label" for="accountPhone">聯絡電話</label>
                    <input type="phone" name="accountPhone" id="accountPhone" class="form-control bg-white px-5 py-2" placeholder="0912345678">
                </div>
                <div class="mb-7">
                    <label class="form-label" for="accountCity">所在位置</label>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                        <select class="form-select bg-white py-2 px-5 border-gray-400 rounded-3" id="accountCity" aria-label="Default select example">
                            <option disabled>請選擇城市</option>
                            <option value="台北市" selected>台北市</option>
                            <option value="新北市">新北市</option>
                            <option value="基隆市">基隆市</option>
                        </select>
                        <select class="form-select bg-white py-2 px-5 border-gray-400 rounded-3" id="accountDistrict" aria-label="Default select example">
                            <option disabled>請選擇地區</option>
                            <option value="信義區" selected>信義區</option>
                            <option value="中正區">中正區</option>
                            <option value="南港區">南港區</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mb-7">
                    <label class="form-label" for="accountIntro">個人介紹</label>
                    <textarea class="form-control bg-white px-5 py-2" name="accountIntro" id="accountIntro" rows="8">大家好,我是一個熱愛美食並喜歡與他人分享美食的人。
無論是自己動手做的料理,還是發現的美味餐廳,我都樂於與朋友們分享這些美好的食物體驗。
希望能夠通過分享美食,讓大家的生活更加豐富和快樂!😊</textarea>
                </div>
            </form>
            <div class="border-top rounded-bottom-3 bg-white">
                <div class="d-flex">
                    <a href="#">變更密碼</a>
                    <div>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-dark">更新個人設定</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>